<p>NOTE: Mylan's 50 percent share of the net sales of Somerset for the three months ended Sept. 30, 1996 and 1995 was $13,112,000 and $13,590,000 respectively and for the six months ended was $28,184,000 and $25,089,000 respectively.</p>
<p>Somerset's contribution to the company's net earnings for the three month and six month period was $0.04 and $0.08 in 1996 and $0.05 and $0.09 in 1995. Somerset Pharmaceuticals is co-owned by Watson Pharmaceuticals Inc.</p>
